    #          2's unbound-prefix message, read from the phase commit's xml.rs;
    #       L4 the same element with q bound to the main namespace on it, the
    #          control for L3: exit 0, its line (the links appended with q).
    # Each refusal: exit 2, the error line exactly the message the committed
    # source holds, no stdout, no output file. Then the messages of this phase,
    # read from the source, compared as SETS with those reached here and those
    # the log states unreachable, with the reason for each; and two usage shapes.
