    #     the template's worksheet part right after its empty sheetData. The
    #     unbound-prefix case is P2's own requirement here (specs/0019 "P2").
    #  L. The messages of this phase are the constants from LINK_EMPTY to
    #     TWO_SHEET_ELEMENTS in the source, read by constant name, each checked
    #     non-empty and present in the spec, and that set compared with the
    #     reached and the stated-unreachable ones.
    #  M. The usage shapes: an extra argument after --link-sample, and the link
